url: https://github.com/zjg-74/x-s-mera
abstract: >-
  Reference simulation code for the X-S-MERA theoretical framework. The framework interprets
  AI hallucination, reasoning oscillation and cognitive stagnation as endogenous information
  residuals caused by manifold dimensionality-reduction projection. The LE (Life-Environment)
  prototype extends the same formal machinery (boundary overlap d, D encapsulation, C1/C2
  conditions, F1/F2 failure modes) to coupled subsystem dynamics, and ships a Lean 4
  formalization of the LE axiom system L1 layer.
keywords:
  - manifold projection
  - asymmetric potential well
  - cognitive dynamics
  - hallucination
  - multiscale coupling
  - Lean 4 formalization
